2026-07-27T07:49:47.1360363Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:49:47.1419915Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:49:47.1420612Z i /tmp/RtmpIokExt/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:49:47.1420968Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:49:47.1421393Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:49:47.1422423Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:49:47.1423039Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:49:47.1424005Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:49:47.1424663Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:49:47.1641401Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:49:47.1748292Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:49:47.2138091Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:49:47.2280324Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
